Modifications
-------------

Changes were made to the original work, starting in 2026; they are recorded in
the git history of https://github.com/Nursqode/KeyStan. In outline:

* the application was renamed to KeyStan and its application id changed to
  de.nursqode.keystan, so that it neither collides with nor presents itself as
  the original application;
* a desktop application for Windows was added under desktop/, reading and writing
  the same vault format as the Android app;
* work on the Android interface: the search bar is pinned, the header shows the
  application name and version on a themed surface, and list rows are compact;
* the desktop application ships an English and Russian text catalogue, following
  the system language by default.

